@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 150
hide empty description
title Conceptual classification of a candidate bundle pair
state "Candidate pair" as Candidate
state Relatedness <<choice>>
state "No qualifying relationship" as Excluded
state "Related pair" as Related
state Evidence <<choice>>
state "Direction unresolved" as Unresolved
state "Equivalent relationship" as Equivalent
state "Directed candidate" as Directed
state Selection <<choice>>
state "Selected predecessor edge" as Selected
state "Additional directed relationship" as Additional
[*] --> Candidate
Candidate --> Relatedness : evaluate pair
Relatedness --> Excluded : [not related]
Relatedness --> Related : [related]
Related --> Evidence : classify change and resolve direction
Evidence --> Equivalent : [equivalent]
Evidence --> Directed : [directed]
Evidence --> Unresolved : [unresolved]
Directed --> Selection : rank predecessors
Selection --> Selected : [chosen; no cycle]
Selection --> Additional : [not selected]
Excluded --> [*]
Unresolved --> [*]
Equivalent --> [*]
Selected --> [*]
Additional --> [*]
note top of Related
  Declared source is checked before fallback.
  Conflicts remain unresolved. Without a source,
  equivalent states remain undirected; otherwise
  fallback evidence may support direction.
end note
note bottom of Selected
  Selected edges enter family scanning.
  Scanner flags are a separate outcome.
end note
@enduml
